{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00353","headline":"避暑摩诃池上作 · 後蜀嗣主孟昶","name":"避暑摩诃池上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冰肌玉骨清无汗，水殿风来暗香暖。\n帘开明月独窥人，敧枕钗横云鬓乱。\n起来琼户寂无声，时见疎星渡河汉。\n屈指西风几时来，只恐流年暗中换。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後蜀嗣主孟昶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}